"`getHabitatRpcConnectionState() === \"connected\"`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:35
msgid "Tier 1：`withOfflineCache()` 内置 gate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:35
msgid ""
"Tier 2 模块：`api.ts` / store 在拉列表前先读本地缓存，gate 为 false 时直接返"
"回、不等待 RPC 超时"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:35
msgid ""
"`flushOfflineModule` / `flushAllOfflineModules`：gate 为 false 时 no-op，重连"
"后由 `OfflineSyncBootstrap` 触发 flush；flush 进行中的新请求会在本轮结束后再"
"跑一轮（尾触发）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:35
msgid ""
"自动 flush 连续失败达到 5 次后停止重试；`OfflineSyncBootstrap` 展示失败/冲突"
"原因，支持单条重试、丢弃与「重连并重试全部」"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:35
msgid ""
"chat 流式 flush 在离开聊天页时回退到 headless context，全局 bar 仍可 flush"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:37
msgid ""
"写 RPC 可选 `client_op_id`；flush 重试使用同一 id；create 响应含完整 `item` "
"供 id-map 写入。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "**在线也走 outbox**：Diary / Task / Project 的写路径（含 create）始终先写本地 KV + outbox，再 `scheduleFlush`；并非「仅离线才排队」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Temp id 生命周期契约（Tier 2-CRUD）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:43
msgid "create flush 成功后，本地世界里不得再以「裸 temp id」作为查找键："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:49
msgid ""
"**Lookup 前解析**：update / delete / append 若传入 temp id，先经 "
"`getIdMapping` 解析再查本地列表"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:49
msgid ""
"**Flush 后立刻 rewrite KV**：create 成功写 id-map 的同时，把本地列表中的 "
"temp 行改成 server id（不要只靠 `refreshAll` 丢掉 temp）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:49
msgid ""
"**UI remap**：订阅 `subscribeIdMappings`，把选中态 / 列表中的 temp 换成 real"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:49
msgid "**Compact 持久化**：`compactOutbox` 吸收的原始 op 必须从 IDB 删除"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:49
msgid ""
"**Allocator seed**：写前 `seedTempIdAllocatorFromIdMap`，避免刷新后复用仍映射"
"中的负 id"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/offline-platform.md:51
msgid ""
"Pomodoro（Hybrid）不使用 temp entity id，不受本契约约束；session 用 "
"`client_op_id` 幂等。"
msgstr ""

